<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Unlock (spell)</h1>
<p>Sphere: Protection Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 18), Conjurer (guild level 27), Thief (guild level 35)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast unlock &lt;door&gt;
cast unlock &lt;direction&gt; &lt;door&gt;
cast unlock &lt;container&gt;
</pre>
<p>Unlocks a closed, locked door or container by magic, without a key: *click*. 
A door is unlocked from both sides at once. Then you can open it (see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Open</a>).
</p><p>Magic opens even locks that can't be picked. But places and things 
steeped in magic resist it: the stronger the magic resistance of the 
room a door is in (or of the room beyond it, if that is stronger), or of 
the container, the more power your spell needs. When it hasn't enough, 
the lock resists your magic.
</p><p>For locking by magic, see <a cmd='#'>Help Spell Lock</a>. For unlocking with a key, see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Unlock</a>. You must be standing. It is also found on wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Spell Lock</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Unlock</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Pick Lock</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Protection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>